---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import founder from '@/assets/images/about/founder.png';
---

<section class="py-15 md:py-30" aria-labelledby="founder-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-146.75 flex-col items-center gap-10 text-center">
      <div class="flex w-full flex-col items-center gap-3.75">
        <p class="text-muted-foreground text-base leading-none font-bold uppercase">Founder</p>
        <h2 id="founder-heading" class="text-3xl leading-[1.1] font-bold md:text-5xl">Meet Kevin Grubinski</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="flex w-full max-w-110.75 flex-col items-center gap-7.5">
        <p class="text-base leading-none">
          Kevin Grubinski has been serving in missions since 2004. After years as a missionary in the Dominican Republic, he developed a passion for helping churches move beyond simply taking
          trips to building lifelong disciples.
        </p>

        <figure class="bg-cream flex w-81 max-w-full items-center rounded-sm px-3 pt-3 pb-15 shadow-[0_4px_7.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)]">
          <div class="relative aspect-square min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-hidden rounded-sm">
            <Image src={founder} alt="Kevin Grubinski, founder of Crew419" width={600} height={600} class="size-full object-cover" />
          </div>
        </figure>

        <p class="text-base leading-none">
          His experience leading teams around the world has shaped Crew419 into an organization that values preparation, trusted partnerships, and Gospel-centered service above tourism.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
